ped with message, no duplicates, exit code 0\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-26\",\n      \"given\": \"A previously imported plan where @json-output has changed content\",\n      \"when\": \"kspec plan import <path> --update is run\",\n      \"then\": \"Existing spec @json-output is updated to match plan content including description, type, tags, traits, and acceptance_criteria; message shows Updated @json-output\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-27\",\n      \"given\": \"A plan with additional tasks array in Tasks section (tasks without specs)\",\n      \"when\": \"kspec plan import <path> is run\",\n      \"then\": \"Manual tasks are created with plan_ref. If spec_ref is explicitly provided in the task YAML, it is honored and normalized; otherwise no spec_ref is set\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-28\",\n      \"given\": \"A plan has been imported with slug auth-redesign\",\n      \"when\": \"@auth-redesign is used in any kspec command\",\n      \"then\": \"Reference resolves to the plan (ReferenceIndex includes plans)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-29\",\n      \"given\": \"A plan with 5 specs where 2 have validation errors\",\n      \"when\": \"kspec plan import <path> is run (default behavior)\",\n      \"then\": \"Valid specs are created, errors logged, exit code 0 with summary output\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-32\",\n      \"given\": \"A plan file is imported\",\n      \"when\": \"kspec plan import <path> --json is run\",\n      \"then\": \"Output is JSON with created specs, tasks, and any errors\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-33\",\n      \"given\": \"Plan import encounters a missing parent reference\",\n      \"when\": \"Error is displayed\",\n      \"then\": \"Message includes recovery hint: Check parent exists or define it earlier in plan\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ac-34\",\n      \"given\": \"A plan file has a ## Specs section header but no fenced YAML code block inside it\",\n      \"when\": \"kspec plan import 